{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":122,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"d","content":["A Song of degrees of David. "]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 122:1"},"I was glad when they said unto me, Let us go into the house of the LORD. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 122:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 122:2"},"Our feet shall stand within thy gates, O Jerusalem. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 122:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 122:3"},"Jerusalem is builded as a city that is compact together: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 122:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 122:4"},"Whither the tribes go up, the tribes of the LORD, unto the testimony of Israel, to give thanks unto the name of the LORD. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 122:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 122:5"},"For there are set thrones of judgment, the thrones of the house of David. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 122:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 122:6"},"Pray for the peace of Jerusalem: they shall prosper that love thee. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 122:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 122:7"},"Peace be within thy walls, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," prosperity within thy palaces. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 122:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 122:8"},"For my brethren and companions’ sakes, I will now say, Peace ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["be "]},"within thee. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 122:8"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PSA 122:9"},"Because of the house of the LORD our God I will seek thy good. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 122:9"}]}]}
